Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.46,0:00:06.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你看  太不可思议了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, check it out. This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊已经憋气将近四分钟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey has been holding his breath for almost four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猪头  你想闷死我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude! You trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我问你件事  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, I wanna ask you something. Uh-huh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,既然我要搬出去  你又这么美丽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, well, since I'm moving out and you're so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我搬去跟你住如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...how about I move in with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:31.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  但是狄妮丝怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that would be great, but then what do we do about Denise?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是狄妮丝  我的室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's Denise? My roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有室友  对  狄妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have a roommate? Yes, Denise. Denise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛啊  菲比  这么神秘\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what is with the secrecy, Phoebe? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个狄妮丝  她可爱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what about this Denise? She cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么会不知道你有室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can you have a roommate that none of us know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是因为都没人在听我讲话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe because you never listen to anything I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一天到晚都提起她   狄妮丝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I talk about her all the time. Denise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.26,0:00:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我在想  我那里会多一个房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Rach, listen,  I was thinkin’ uh, I'm gonna have an extra room over at my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  你何不搬来跟我住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's true. Yeah, Why don't you move in with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.06,0:01:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多好啊  我们可以熬夜谈心  看电影\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'll be great. We can stay up late talking, watch movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道赤裸星期四的规定吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know about naked Thursdays, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.61,0:01:11.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还是自己找房子好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah, I think I'm gonna find my own place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为赤裸星期四  是我们的专利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey. I thought naked Thursdays was just our thing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.99,0:01:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第3集  爱与不爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E03 The One With Ross’s Denial
