Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.86,0:01:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没办注销  瑞秋怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what did Rachel say when you told her you were still married to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个啊  她还蛮平静的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that. Um, she took it really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.50,0:02:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没说  对吧  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. You didn't tell her, did you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.83,0:02:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有  因为你爱她  我并不爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course not, Because you're in love with her. I am not in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她在为搬家的事难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was very upset about having to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就没说  免得她更不开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I didn't tell her we were still married, because she'd only get more upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是以一个朋友的身份安慰她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I-I just comforted her, As a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.18,0:02:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫安慰她  也没什么  我抱了抱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean, "comforted her"? It was nothing. I gave her a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拥抱  正是爱的表示\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aha. A classic sign of love, the hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是友情的表现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's also a sign of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.36,0:02:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里不是  痴情男\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, not in your case, Lovey Loverson.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:36.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那只是个拥抱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我   你有没有闻她的头发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just tell me this, did you or did you not smell her hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闻她的头发   如果有呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Smell her hair? Well, what if I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:47.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九成女性的荷尔蒙散发自头部\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ninety percent of a woman's pheromones come out the top of her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以女人都比较矮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That’s why, that's why women are shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:54.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好让男人在拥抱时爱上她们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So that men will fall in love when they hug them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:57.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  罗斯  你还是个科学家呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Ross, you're a scientist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:03:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是以一个朋友的身份抱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was hugging her as a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是把脸埋进她的头发里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not my fault her hair got in my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:06.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的头发很多  有一股\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's got a lot of it, and it smells all, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道的  椰子香\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know, coconutty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.64,0:03:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又怎样么  那不代表我对她有感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Oh. It doesn't mean I have feelings for Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.06,0:03:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我是对椰子有感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe it means I have feelings for coconuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.69,0:03:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  随你怎么说  但你要小心  瑞秋的心情和你不同\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, whatever you say. But just be careful. Rachel's not in the same place you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这个心情是指的爱情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, if the place you're referring to is being in love...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那她和我的心情一样   因为我不是那个心情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then she is in the same place as me, because I am not in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.37,0:03:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我听不懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I didn't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:38.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但或许是因为  你讲得是爱的秘语\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But maybe that's because you were speaking the secret language of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:46.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才有你的电话  是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, some guy just called for you. Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我哪知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不 "谢我帮你留言"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about "Thanks for taking the message"? Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.06,0:03:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等你搬进来   瑞秋的房间就空出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you move in, Rachel's room's gonna be empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.73,0:03:57.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不要来讨论一下  怎么利用啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanna talk about what we wanna do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们应该弄个漂亮的客房\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think we should have a beautiful guest room, right? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有红木雪橇床  床头桌上永远插着鲜花\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with a mahogany sleigh bed and bedside tables with flowers on them all the time! 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:08.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再摆张卷盖式书桌   放上留言卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then we could have a rolltop desk with comment cards...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让客人表达他们的开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so people can tell us how much they love staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之类的  总之我还没有想到太多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whatever, you know, I really haven't thought about it that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这个主意   当然喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I like that idea, obviously. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.05,0:04:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想或许可以弄个游戏房  怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I was thinking maybe-maybe-maybe it could be a game room, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:24.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以买旧的游戏机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you can buy old arcade games...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.72,0:04:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像《太空入侵者》和《小行星》  只要两百元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...like "Space invaders" and "Asteroids" for $200.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像真正的街机  那些大的  大的一台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The real ones. The big, big, big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.14,0:04:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是  "天哪  钱德  太有趣的主意了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, so you mean "no" as in, "Gee, Chandler, what an interesting idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.77,0:04:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们先讨论再全盘否定"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's discuss it before we reject it completely."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  当然啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. I'm sorry. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,确实是很有趣的主意  不过谈过了  还是不要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Interesting idea, um, talk about it, but no.
