Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.75,0:04:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  漂亮的客房不适合放游戏机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I just don't think that arcade games go in the beautiful guest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.58,0:04:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒是应该有很多古董才对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The beautiful guest room's gonna be filled with antiques.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:05:01.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以《小行星》才适合   那是最古老的游戏机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which is why "Asteroids" is perfect. It's the oldest game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.59,0:05:05.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你对漂亮的客房有什么意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you have against the beautiful guest room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:07.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have anything against the guest room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是我们认识的人都住在方圆数公尺内\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Especially since everybody that we know lives about 30 seconds away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.93,0:05:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在嘲笑我吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you mocking me?
