Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.28,0:05:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  摩妮卡和我吵架了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nothing. Monica and I had a stupid fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.36,0:05:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们还是要同居吧  对吧  我的广告今天出来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're still moving in together, right? Because my ad came out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.87,0:05:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"诚征女性室友  不抽烟  不丑"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Wanted: Female roommate, nonsmoker, nonugly."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice. Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.88,0:05:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说在你之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just figured y’know, after living with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:43.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,换个女室友想着还挺有趣的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it'd be an interesting change of pace to have a female roommate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.67,0:05:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个我可以学习   和我不一样的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? Someone I could learn from. Someone who's different than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁和我最不一样   年过十九的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And what's more different than me, a guy who's not 19...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是十九岁的女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...than, say, a girl who is 19?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:57.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是草包  朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not just a hat rack, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.11,0:06:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我想问  嘘  我正在忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, I have to ask you-Shh. I'm swamped right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是在发呆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're just staring into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想移动那支铅笔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I'm trying to move that pencil.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.41,0:06:13.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这支吗  成功了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This one? It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.25,0:06:18.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  找房子真是恶梦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, this whole apartment thing is a nightmare.
