Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个是在吵什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's all this about you guys fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.83,0:12:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的就为了一个房间嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this really over a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.29,0:12:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真是太傻了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, that is so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我们自己可以摆平  显然不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, we can handle this. Well, apparently not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能坐视两个我关心的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I can't just stand by and watch two people I care about so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.89,0:12:53.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为了这么傻的事伤感情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...be hurt by something that is so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.69,0:13:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再傻了  你叫她别傻啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, enough of the silliness. Why don't you tell her to stop being silly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,双方都有理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Two very good points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:13.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你们两个很久了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I've known you both a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.41,0:13:16.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在一起之后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I've never seen either of you one-millionth as happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比以前快乐一百万倍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as you've been since you got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.63,0:13:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的要为了一个房间   放弃这一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you really wanna throw that all away over a room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.55,0:13:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太傻了啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么比较重要  爱情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's more important, love...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.81,0:13:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是傻气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...or silliness?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们喜欢傻气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we are fond of the silliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.98,0:13:39.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但面对爱情也会心软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we also have a soft spot for the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爱是万灵药  欢笑才是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Love is the best medicine. That's laughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.98,0:13:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这样  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you do it? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  钱德  你想跟摩妮卡住吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, Chandler, you wanna live with Monica, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我想啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  你想跟钱德住吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, Mon, you wanna live with Chandler, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:00.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.54,0:14:04.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  口头契约  在纽约州有约束力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. A verbal contract is binding in the state of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:12.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你在找房子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I understand you're looking for a place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不搬了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, I'm staying put. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我本来打算找你来我家住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was going to offer you my apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么  你要去哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说了你一定不信  钱德和摩妮卡又要同居了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, you're never gonna believe it. Monica and Chandler are moving in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.54,0:14:44.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了  对他们来说  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great news, right? I mean, for them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:45.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过好处是  我们又能当室友了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But on the bright side, we get to be roommates again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  关于这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You know, about that, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很感谢你主动提议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, ahem, I really appreciate your offer to let me move in and everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你不觉得会很怪吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but don't you think it's gonna be weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.77,0:15:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为…为什么会怪啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why? Why would it--? Why would it be weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:10.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know, because of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.91,0:15:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的过去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because of our history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.37,0:15:14.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会  不会吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.04,0:15:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我们还余情未了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It would only be weird if we were still in that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.67,0:15:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还余情未了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, are you still in that place?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也没有  很好  我也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, not at all. Good. Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就没问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是刚好是室友的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're just two friends who happen to be roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  但我们迟早会约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but, Ross, eventually, you and I are gonna be dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.68,0:15:41.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我们吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? We are?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.85,0:15:45.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我会有男朋友  你会有女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, yeah. I'm gonna have a boyfriend and you're gonna have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.27,0:15:47.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.03,0:15:50.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过如果你觉得无所谓  我们就想一套做法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if you think it's gonna be okay, we'll just work out a system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像大学时代   我在门上挂个牌子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It'll be like in college. I'll hang a hanger on the door and put a sign:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"暂且回避  正在炒饭"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Come back later. I'm getting lucky."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想都没想过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I didn't think of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.17,0:16:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们确定要住在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So are you sure about this whole moving-in thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是很大的进展   急什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, it's a really big step. And what's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.52,0:16:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在装傻  因为他知道我们喜欢傻气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's being silly because he knows we enjoy the silliness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是说真的  你们想想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm serious, okay? I mean, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你搬进来  你们为了游戏房的事吵架\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You move in, you start fighting over stupid game rooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就会分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...next thing you know, you break up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你说得对  吵那种架真的很蠢啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you were right before. It was just a stupid fight about a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.62,0:16:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点也不蠢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, there are no stupid fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.75,0:16:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重点不是房间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't about the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:52.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是房间代表什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is about what the room represents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:56.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸的  这个房间会毁了你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And unfortunately, this room could destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没那么担心  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm not so worried. Yeah, no, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这是你们的人生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.27,0:17:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想看到你们分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't wanna see you break up. y’know 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.10,0:17:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要是同居就会分手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Which you will do if you move in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:15.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你们想这样  我也没办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if that's what you want, there's nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.66,0:17:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还是想搬进来吧  当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You still wanna move in together, right? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.21,0:17:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯没吓到你吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross didn't scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.79,0:17:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吓得我死也不敢跟他住\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Scared me out of ever wanting to live with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  我给你看样东西  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here, I gotta show you something. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  正方形人被杀了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, someone's killed Square Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.97,0:17:42.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得懒人椅可以放这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is where the Barcalounger could go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.14,0:17:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以看电视  离厨房又够近\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You see, you can see the TV, and still, it's walking distance to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.90,0:17:49.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真周到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.86,0:17:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也有事要说  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna show you something too! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:54.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道道路会合的标志吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know those big-big uh, road signs that say "merge"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:17:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们可以弄一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? So I was thinking we could get one of those signs...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挂在床头上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and hang it over our bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你和我就是那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because that's you and I together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.25,0:18:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,合而为一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Merge."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.29,0:18:10.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我好喜欢啊  真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, I love that. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.42,0:18:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"No."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.09,0:18:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我发现你在我床上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I found you in my bed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.51,0:18:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How'd you wind up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.35,0:18:24.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个谜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are a mystery
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小黑卷毛男\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Little black curly hair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.98,0:18:29.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小黑葱毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Little black curly hair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小黑葱毛  小黑葱毛  小黑葱毛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Little black, little black Little black, little black
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小黑云毛男\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Little black curly hair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果想收到我的演出电邮讯息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you wanna receive e-mails about my upcoming shows...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:50.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请捐钱给我   让我买电脑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then please give me money so I can buy a computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.84,0:18:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, uh... Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where are the other guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.72,0:19:00.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和钱德在忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's see, Monica and Chandler are occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吵架  不  是忙别的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fighting? No, the other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.81,0:19:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真高兴他们能和好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really think it's great they worked things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁也别想拆散他们  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, there's no breaking them up, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.89,0:19:13.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以跟你借钥匙去配一副吗   当然可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, can I borrow the key to your house so I can make a copy? Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.23,0:19:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿去  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:20.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,配了钥匙  就不能反悔了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because once I make a copy, there's no turning back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我确定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.24,0:19:25.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趁我改变心意前快去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now get out of here before I change my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, listen, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.25,0:19:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟瑞秋住真的好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}do you really think this moving in with Rachel is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也在摇摆不定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been back and forth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许你应该摆回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, maybe you should go back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋搬进去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel moves in, and before you know it...
